<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil telcoms still an ING buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil telcoms still an ING buy.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said it was maintaining its buy ratings on Telerj, Telemig Telemig and Telepar, units of federal Telebras system.</p>
<p>- Telerj preferred was up 6.46 percent at 173 reais on the Sao Paulo bolsa.</p>
<p>- Telemig preferred was up 1.54 percent at 198 reais.</p>
<p>- Telepar preferred was up 3.37 percent at 920.01 reais.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
